        "slc_e98e9401c5cd2818800e9e3206cfe003ed314f53dea533bad3fe7dfb4520dbc9"
      ],
      "text": "The project ships two binaries: the main `codirigent` app and a `codirigent-hook` binary that gets registered into supported CLIs' configuration files for real-time agent status tracking."
    },
