        "slc_39eb85c0024d77b81e6038cdcb3f219665573306f12db07cd155110a18cfb839"
      ],
      "text": "Status tracking uses lightweight hooks registered into each CLI's config (Claude Code at ~/.claude/settings.json, Codex at ~/.codex/config.toml, Gemini at ~/.gemini/settings.json); when hooks are unavailable it falls back to a less precise reader/detector path."
    },
